        <h2>Why We Started This Journey</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 20px;">When I brought home my first puppy, I was completely overwhelmed. Every Google search led to conflicting advice. Every pet store employee recommended something different. I just wanted one reliable place with honest, expert-backed information.</p>
        <p style="color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 20px;">That's why PetBuddyHub exists. We're real pet parents who've been through it all. The midnight vet visits, the chewed-up shoes, and the unconditional love that makes every challenge worth it.</p>
        <p style="color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 20px;">Our mission is simple: <strong>make pet care less stressful and more joyful.</strong> Every article is researched, every product review is honest, and every tip has been tested by actual pet owners.</p>
        <a href="/start-here/" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 12px;">Start Here {{ icon("arrow-right", 16) }}</a>
      </div>
      <img src="/assets/zigmarsberzins-girl-5623231_1920.jpg" alt="Pet owner bonding with dog" loading="lazy">
